      ],
      "comment": "Ann: Mary-Ann (the Oceanid)",
      "content": "The Oceanid Mary-Ann is the merged being of Lyris and Mary-Ann Guillotin. She built Annapausis and, dreaming of a small brave Oceanid, brought Ann into being. She is courteous, loves tea and flowers and prefers a gentle fairy-tale to harsh facts, but she sends Ann out to see the real world. After the Rowboat's Wake events she plans to travel with Ann.",
