      "content": "Narzissenkreuz is the gestalt body made by Jakob to hold Rene's persona. In Rowboat's Wake he leads Ann and the Traveler through the Annapausis, reveals himself to Mary-Ann as Rene, and fades after a last talk with Ann. Ann forgives him.",
