      "content": "Annapausis is the dream-world of the merged Oceanid Mary-Ann: a kind place of tea, sunflowers and storybook rooms where the children of the old Narzissenkreuz Institute might still play. It is her protected refuge, where she cares for the garden. It is also, as she says, a tomb.",
